  "label": "Political Satire and Meme Culture",
  "description": "The meme format is a common tool in political satire and online discourse, often used to express strong opinions or criticisms about public figures. The juxtaposition of a formal, dignified image with vulgar text is a deliberate stylistic choice to create a jarring contrast and emphasize the insult.",
